  "bio": "Brenda Gabriella is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in stunning floral designs, seamlessly blending the grace of flowers with the artistry of ink. Her studio in São José, Brazil, is a testament to her adherence to cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every client that walks through her doors. Brenda's dedication to maintaining a pristine workspace goes hand in hand with the intricate and beautiful tattoos she creates.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: São José, Santa Catarina, Brazil\n\n@baita.tattoo✯microrealismo \n✯AGENDA ABERTA✯\nTOUR 2026 🇧🇷\n📍BSB•10-13/03  \n📍BH•14-21/03  \n📍RIO•22-25/03  \n📍SP•26-28/03\n📍FLN•SEMPRE \nContato via link",
